      "Segmented hip-wrapping white apron with angled lobes, stepped hem and blue rear underskirt"
    ],
    "macroFormPlan": "V36b replaces the rejected tower-cap and placard-apron read. Cap height is compressed into four broad overlapping folds. Apron is built from a shallow yoke, angled upper side panels, staggered lower lobes and narrow hip wraps so the contour follows the body instead of hanging as one board.",
